
Simple navigation demo 

- Yoonsuck Choe

* See README-DIFF for differences between the original anji code and this modified version.

Train:
        ./evolve.sh navi.properties
	

	* result will go in: 

		db/ ...

	  and output will be dumped on your screen.

	* You can find the chromosomes specifying
	  network topology in
	
                	db/chromosome/13178.xml

Test:

        ./navi_evaluate.sh navi.properties 13178
		
		* use the chromosome number for best individual

configuration files

        properties/...
                navi.properties
                xor.properties

soruce files : These are new, compared to the original anji code

	src/com/anji/navi/ .....

	
	* To build a file after modifying, do, e.g.,

		./build.sh src/com/anji/navi/NaviFitnessFunction.java

